-- Aligns ingredient inStore flags with what the Choo Foodstore actually carries.
-- Rule: fresh meat, seafood and non-Asian basics (plain water, table salt/sugar,
-- olive oil, ketchup, peanut butter, honey, fresh herbs grown locally) stay
-- inStore=false. Everything else we stock (Asian sauces, pastes, spices,
-- noodles, rice, dried/preserved goods, frozen items, Asian fresh produce and
-- aromatics like garlic/ginger/scallions/onion/carrot/cucumber) flips to
-- inStore=true with an appropriate aisle.
-- Each UPDATE overwrites ingredients_json for a (recipe_id, locale) row.

